sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title HackMatch — US-002: Federated OAuth Registration and Authentication — Sign-In Sequence
    actor Visitor
    participant UI as React OAuth Controls
    participant Provider as Firebase + Google/GitHub
    participant API as Express Auth API
    participant DB as Supabase PostgreSQL
    participant OTP as US-004 OTP Boundary

    Visitor->>UI: Choose Google or GitHub and optional profile consent
    UI->>Provider: signInWithPopup
    alt Popup cancelled, blocked, offline, or provider fails
        Provider--xUI: Firebase provider error
        UI-->>Visitor: Actionable error, preserve consent, no session
    else Provider returns credential
        UI->>UI: Early email and emailVerified usability check
        alt Email missing or visibly unverified
            UI-->>Visitor: Divert to email registration/verification
        else Client check passes
            UI->>Provider: Get Firebase ID token
            UI->>API: POST /api/auth/oauth/sign-in<br/>{idToken, provider, consentHandleAvatar}
            API->>Provider: Verify ID token and declared provider match
            alt Invalid token, mismatch, unverified email, or ADMIN claim
                API-->>UI: Explicit 400/401/403, zero session and zero write
            else Valid public OAuth identity
                API->>DB: Find provider identity, otherwise find participant by email
                alt Existing provider identity belongs to PART
                    DB-->>API: Linked participant
                    API->>DB: Confirm participant is active and not ADMIN
                else Email already belongs to an unlinked account
                    DB-->>API: Existing participant by email
                    API-->>UI: 409 LINKING_REAUTHENTICATION_REQUIRED
                    UI-->>Visitor: Sign in with existing account to link, no auto-link
                else New provider identity
                    API->>DB: INSERT participants(role=PART, is_verified=true)
                    API->>DB: INSERT provider_identities<br/>(handle/avatar only with consent)
                    Note over API,DB: Current operations are separate, not one transaction.<br/>Identity-insert failure can leave the participant row.
                end
                API->>OTP: Create and send email OTP challenge
                alt Account locked, rate limited, or delivery fails
                    OTP--xAPI: Explicit failure
                    API-->>UI: 423/429/502, no authorized session
                else OTP challenge issued
                    OTP-->>API: Challenge identifier and masked email
                    API-->>UI: 200 requiresOtp=true, no cookie or access token
                    UI-->>Visitor: Continue to mandatory email OTP
                end
            end
        end
    end

    Note over Visitor,OTP: A verified provider is only primary authentication. Team actions remain blocked until US-004 succeeds.

